WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
I need 100 matte prints for an event in three days.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
I want AI help. I still need control over the purchase.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
The cheapest offer may arrive too late.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Price, timing and terms all shape the choice.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
These are illustrative quotes, not merchant commitments.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:39.000
An actual model explanation called Atlas cheapest. Birch cost less with a three-day estimate.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Another assumed an uncertain deadline was acceptable and mislabeled cents as USD.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Vowrail keeps purchase permission explicit.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Agents propose. The deterministic gateway enforces the bounds.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Here the buyer permits at most USD 220 and two negotiation rounds.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:08.000
The stored mandate stays outside the model’s reasoning.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Sellers receive public requirements, not the private ceiling.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:19.000
The gateway authorizes each round. Two means two.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:24.000
Retained checks refused a third round, invented offers and above-budget checkout.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:30.000
The gateway enforces the rule. A disabled button only displays it.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:36.000
I compare the stored price, delivery estimate and expiry before choosing.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:42.000
Delivery and missing tax or refund terms still need buyer review.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:48.000
Order creation, buyer approval and capture remain separate steps.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:54.000
An expired quote cannot begin checkout. An expired mandate cannot authorize capture.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:02:00.000
Previously completed payment status remains readable. This is a synthetic expiry replay.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:05.000
In an earlier separate Sandbox run, one authorized USD 207 purchase completed.

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:11.000
Independent checks matched the amount, currency and reference.

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:16.000
This is a text summary. The synthetic seller was not the configured payee.

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:23.000
If a payment response is uncertain, check the stored outcome before trying again.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:30.000
Earlier restart restored the completed receipt after expiry. Recovery made no capture call.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:35.000
Use AI help while keeping purchase permission explicit and the outcome checkable.

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:40.000
Delivery terms need review. Model explanations remain unverified.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:45.000
Model tests and the Sandbox purchase were separate runs. Private review only.
